    <ReasonableCauseExplanation documentId="R000004" softwareId="23018249" softwareVersionNum="v1.00">
      <ExplanationTxt>The Sutro Elementary PTA, a volunteer-run nonprofit organization, regrets the delay in filing Form 990-EZ for the fiscal year ending June 30, 2024. The organization is managed by rotating parent volunteers with no paid administrative staff, and a transition in PTA leadership caused a delay in transferring records and completing the filing. Once the oversight was discovered, the new board took immediate steps to gather the necessary documentation and complete the filing. We respectfully request the IRS to waive any late filing penalties based on reasonable cause and not willful neglect. The organization remains committed to timely compliance in the future.</ExplanationTxt>
